  "id":"tx-pu-math-contest-v2-ch1-1.1-ex-05","subject":"math","l2":"函数极限与连续","l3_id":"math.calc.limit.compute","atom_id":"","book_id":"","ability_goal":"construct","item_form":"blank","difficulty":"hit","question":"求 $y=\\sqrt{x^2-x+1}-\\sqrt{x^2+x+1}$ 的反函数及定义域.","answer":"定义域为 $|y|<1$.","ref_source":"textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2","techniques":["反函数","配方变形"],"solution":{"steps":[{"id":"s1","text":"分析 由 $y=f(x)$ 解关于 $x$ 的方程，再交换变量."},{"id":"s2","text":"当 $x>0$ 时 $y<0$；当 $x<0$ 时 $y>0$."},{"id":"s3","text":"两边平方."},{"id":"s4","text":"$y^2=2(x^2+1)-2\\sqrt{x^4+x^2+1}$."},{"id":"s5","text":"移项并再平方."},{"id":"s6","text":"化简得到 $x$ 关于 $y$ 的表达式."},{"id":"s7","text":"交换变量得反函数."}],"final_answer":"$y=-\\frac{x}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{4-x^2}{1-x^2}},\\ |x|<1$.","techniques_used":["反函数","配方变形"]},"cdps":[{"id":"c1","prompt":"外层/内层函数的定义域分段如何决定复合后的区间划分？","technique":"反函数","expected":"先按外层分段条件反解内层，得到自变量区间，再代入对应表达式。"},{"id":"c2","prompt":"最终显式表达式（或所求对象）的关键结构是什么？","technique":"配方变形","expected":"$y=-\\frac{x}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{4-x^2}{1-x^2}},\\ |x|<1$."}],"meta":{"source":"textbook_example","book_id":"puheping_math_contest_v2","book_title":"","book_author":"蒲和平","chapter":"","section":"1.1","example_id":"例5*","page":10,"quality_basis":"source_textbook_worked_example","starred":true}}
